    "body": "Yes, I wonder if we are not over-engineering the `shouldComponentUpdate` of our components. I'm not really familiar with it but I would have thought that React was already doing the deep comparison check of the passed data?\n",
    "commit_id": "d9e85823f711f2b8adfc50368923831e0686dcce",
